   "proposition": "The English states that a real copy of the raw linelist is first written into the \"data/linelists\" sub-folder with `appliedepidata::save_data()` so that the code chunk below actually runs as written; the Vietnamese sentence stops after \"import() is being provided a file path constructed with here()\" and never mentions this.",
