   "tr_span": "chapters/importing.vn.qmd:89-89",
   "proposition": "The prose names the file passed to `here()` as \"ebola_linelist.xlsx\", but the code chunk immediately above (line 86) and the expanded absolute path immediately below (line 91) both use \"linelist_raw.xlsx\"; the English prose says \"linelist_raw.xlsx\" and is consistent.",
   "reader_consequence": "The Vietnamese reader is shown a `here()` call with one file name and told it expands to a path ending in a different file name, so the demonstration of how `here()` builds a path no longer follows, and a reader copying the command uses a file that does not exist in the example project.",
